T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* 1. Simple Cubic \(SC\): Lattice points at 8 corners. Total atoms per cell: N = 8 *) Tj
T*
(\(1/8\) = 1. Coordination Number = 6. Nearest neighbor distance: 2*r = a. Atomic) Tj
T*
(Packing Factor: APF = pi / 6 ~= 0.52 \(52%\).) Tj
T*
(* 2. Body-Centered Cubic \(BCC\): Points at 8 corners + 1 at body center \(e.g.,) Tj
T*
(alpha-Ferrite steel at room temp\). Atoms per cell: N = 8*\(1/8\) + 1 = 2. Coordination) Tj
T*
(Number = 8. Body diagonal: 4*r = a * sqrt\(3\) => r = a * sqrt\(3\) / 4. APF = pi *) Tj
T*
(sqrt\(3\) / 8 ~= 0.68 \(68%\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. Face-Centered Cubic \(FCC\): Points at 8 corners + 6 face centers \(e.g., Austenite) Tj
T*
(steel, Copper, Aluminum\). Atoms per cell: N = 8*\(1/8\) + 6*\(1/2\) = 4. Coordination) Tj
T*
(Number = 12. Face diagonal: 4*r = a * sqrt\(2\) => r = a * sqrt\(2\) / 4. APF = pi *) Tj
T*
(sqrt\(2\) / 6 ~= 0.74 \(74%, close-packed\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
