T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(Miller indices \(hkl\) uniquely define orientation of crystal lattice planes:) Tj
T*
(* Determination Algorithm:) Tj
T*
(- Step 1: Determine intercepts of the plane along crystallographic axes in terms of) Tj
T*
(lattice constants: \(p*a, q*b, r*c\).) Tj
T*
(- Step 2: Take reciprocals of intercept multipliers: \(1/p, 1/q, 1/r\). \(If plane is) Tj
T*
(parallel to an axis, intercept is infinity => reciprocal is 0\).) Tj
T*
