T*
(+ AC = d*sin\(theta\) + d*sin\(theta\) = 2*d*sin\(theta\). For constructive interference, this) Tj
T*
(path difference must equal an integral multiple of wavelength: 2*d*sin\(theta\) = n*lambda) Tj
T*
(\(Bragg's Law\). In experimental crystallography \(X-ray diffractometer\), a sample is) Tj
